:"系统管理"}],[2,{"id":2,"type_id":2,"type_ids":"1,3","title":"Angular开发入门指南","url":"","sub_title":"从零开始学习Angular开发","content":"<h1>Angular开发入门指南</h1><p>Angular是一个强大的Web应用开发框架。本指南将帮助您快速入门。</p><h2>前置条件</h2><p>在开始之前，请确保您的系统已安装Node.js。</p><h2>安装Angular CLI</h2><p>首先安装Angular命令行工具：</p><pre><code>npm install -g @angular/cli</code></pre><h2>创建新项目</h2><p>使用以下命令创建新的Angular项目：</p><pre><code>ng new my-app</code></pre><h2>运行项目</h2><p>进入项目目录并启动开发服务器：</p><pre><code>cd my-app\nng serve</code></pre>","markdown_content":"","is_markdown":0,"abstract":"学习Angular开发的基础知识，从设置第一个项目到构建组件和服务。","redirect_url":"","author_id":1,"remark":"","status":10,"is_review":-10,"image_list":"/assets/images/angular.jpg","image":"/assets/images/angular.jpg","sort":2,"attrs":"","click":0,"tags":"angular,typescript,前端开发,ddddd,对对对","seo_title":"","seo_keywords":"","seo_description":"","user_id":1,"create_time":1751623595129,"update_time":1753334978065,"is_delete":0,"type_name":"广告管理"}],[3,{"id":3,"type_id":2,"type_ids":"1,2","title":"TypeScript基础语法","url":"","sub_title":"掌握TypeScript的核心概念","content":"<h1>TypeScript基础语法</h1><p>TypeScript是Microsoft开发的开源编程语言，它是JavaScript的超集。</p><h2>基本类型</h2><p>TypeScript提供了多种基本类型：</p><ul><li>string - 字符串类型</li><li>number - 数字类型</li><li>boolean - 布尔类型</li><li>array - 数组类型</li><li>object - 对象类型</li></ul><h2>接口定义</h2><p>使用接口定义对象的结构：</p><pre><code>interface User {\n  name: string;\n  age: number;\n  email?: string;\n}</code></pre>","markdown_content":"","is_markdown":0,"abstract":"TypeScript是JavaScript的超集，为JavaScript添加了类型系统。本文将介绍TypeScript的基础语法和核心概念。","redirect_url":"","author_id":1,"remark":"","status":10,"is_review":-10,"image_list":"/assets/images/typescript.jpg","image":"/assets/images/typescript.jpg","sort":3,"attrs":"","click":0,"tags":"typescript,javascript,编程","seo_title":"","seo_keywords":"","seo_description":"","user_id":1,"create_time":1751623595129,"update_time":1752825242061,"is_delete":0,"type_name":"广告管理"}]]